OL,3,GNEWSAHospital sorry after patient's
OL,4,Anil-by-mouth death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA healthcare trust says it has changed
OL,7,Fits guidelines after a 97-year-old
OL,8,Fwoman was given food when she was
OL,9,Fnil-by-mouth, which led to her death.
OL,11,FCoroner for Somerset Vanessa McKinlay
OL,12,Fwrote a prevention of future deaths
OL,13,Freport following the inquest into the
OL,14,Fdeath of Jacqueline Frehe, who died at
OL,15,FYeovil District Hospital in Somerset.
OL,17,FThe inquest heard that when she was
OL,18,Ftransferred from A&E to another ward,
OL,19,Fthe staff there were not made aware
OL,20,Fthat she was nil-by-mouth.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
