OL,3,GNEWSAHospital sorry after patient's
OL,4,Anil-by-mouth death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomerset NHS Foundation Trust said it
OL,7,Fextended its "deepest sympathies" and
OL,8,Fapologised to Frehe's family and
OL,9,Fexplained it was taking action on the
OL,10,Fcoroner's findings.
